## The author is the logged-in user (from the access token), not a body field.
## Seeded users: alice, bob, carol, dave, erin / password123

## Log in - run this first, the requests below use its access token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "login": "alice",
    "password": "password123"
}

###
## Paste an id from a create post response, to reply to it
@postId = paste-post-id-here
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

## Create post - expect 201, authorId is alice
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "body": "Hello, BlogGoose!"
}

###
## Reply to a post - expect 201, the parent's replyCount goes up by 1
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "body": "Nice post!",
    "replyToId": "{{postId}}"
}

###
## Reply to an unknown post - expect 404
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "body": "Nice post!",
    "replyToId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"
}

###
## No access token - expect 401
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "body": "Hello, BlogGoose!"
}

###
## authorId in the body (forbidNonWhitelisted) - expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "authorId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
    "body": "Hello, BlogGoose!"
}

###
## Only spaces (trimmed, then @Length(1, 500)) - expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "body": "     "
}

###
## Over 500 characters (@Length(1, 500)) - expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "body": ""
}

###
## replyToId not a UUID (@IsUUID) - expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "body": "Nice post!",
    "replyToId": "abc"
}

###
## Server-owned fields (forbidNonWhitelisted) - expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "body": "Hello, BlogGoose!",
    "likeCount": 1000
}

###
## Empty body, every required field missing - expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}
